WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:05.810
I'll break it on you, I'll now <i>confess</i> the <i>shocking</i> truth!

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.960
TA TADAA!

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:10.180
Merag!

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.440
The one who killed you and Nasch in the Barian World was...

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:15.720
... <i>me</i> in person!

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.220
Merag...

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.580
VECTOR!!

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.000
Get yourself ready!

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:33.180
This turn, I'll scrape all your life off!

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.600
If you can, that is.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:38.660
But if you leave me even one single life point...

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:43.180
the same amount of damage you make me eat will hit back at you.

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:48.420
It's so <i>thrilling</i> to think that this way, I will send you to hell <i>all over again</i>!

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:49.980
Shut up, Vector!

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:53.620
You betrayed us! Your behaviour is impossible to be forgiven!

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:54.440
Durbe.

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.780
<i>I</i> will definitely show Vector his way to hell.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.500
This is my remaining wish.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:03.360
Merag?!

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:05.420
Don't tell me that you...?!

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:09.820
I activate the spell card, "Distortion Crystal"!

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.830
When there's a Water monster on the field,

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:16.970
during this turn, the changes to an opponent's monster's attack are doubled.

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:21.350
Then I activate the Spell Card, "Zero's Blade"!

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:25.670
One monster my opponent controls loses 1000 Attack!

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:27.220
What!?

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:30.970
Combined with Distortion Crystal's Effect,

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:33.400
the Attack of your Monster...

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:36.820
... will lose 2000 Points!

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:39.260
Keh ... do what you have to do.

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:40.840
I'm not done yet!

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:44.310
Now I activate the effect of my Ragna Infinity!

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:49.280
By using 1 Chaos Overlay Unit, I will deal damage
equal to the change in attack

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:50.830
to my opponent!

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:52.110
What!?

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:54.950
Guidance to Purgatory!

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:06.700
You've got some nerve there.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:10.250
But even if you battle Soul Marionetter,

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:13.170
my Life Points won't drop to zero!

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:14.550
Are you sure about that?

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:19.640
I activate Zero Blade's other effect!

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:23.480
This effect allows my
 Ragna Infinity to attack twice!

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:24.570
What!?

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:29.220
Vector, let me repay you for what
you did to me and my brother!

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:33.500
The first is for me! Attack on Soul Marionetter!

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:48.860
While your Soul Marionetter cannot be destroyed
while it's equipped with a Number,

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.170
you still take damage!

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:54.780
And now I can attack once again!

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:57.280
In other words, this is
the end of the line for you!

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:02.500
This is for Nasch!

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:05.100
Attack Soul Marionetter once more!

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:12.200
I activate the Continuous Trap Card,
"Damage Pot"!

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:15.800
This card negates the
damage done by battle!

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.910
It absorbed the damage?

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.820
Such a pity.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:30.510
You weren't able to get rid
of all my Life Points.

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:35.990
I activate the effect
of Don Thousand's throne!

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:39.620
All damage I took this turn,

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:50.860
Thank you, Nasch!

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:53.820
Though you probably know this already,

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:55.890
but when I gain Life Points,

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:59.860
Soul Marionetter gains Attack equal to the same amount!

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:03.770
And then I inflict damage to my opponent

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:05.910
equal to the Life Points I gained!

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:09.200
I took 3300 damage.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:11.460
Now, Merag-<i>chan.</i>

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:13.970
Shall I send you to hell this time?

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.580
Soul Marionetter's effect acti--

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.150
Wait, Vector!

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:28.010
If you raise its attack,
Ragna Infinity's effect will actviate

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:30.570
and we'll take damage.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:34.660
I know. But my life right now is 4000,

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:37.350
I can take 3300 damage.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:43.000
Have you forgotten the effect of Merag's
Spell Card, "Distortion Crystal"?

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.550
Oh... I see!

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:49.480
The change in Attack will be 6600.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:52.150
With that much damage, I'd...

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:56.280
What's wrong, aren't you
going to activate its effect?

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.340
You ... you bitch!

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:02.530
So apparently you figured out
that you were the one to be sent to hell.

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:08.370
But if I activate Soul Marionetter's effect, you'll also take damage!

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:10.700
That was my plan.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:11.880
What!?

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:14.910
Merag... indeed you were going for a tie...?

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:17.930
Whatever it takes
to send that bastard to hell.

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:22.330
In that case, I won't actviate Soul Marionetter's effect!

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:25.640
Looks like your 'invincible combo'
has finally been broken.

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:30.260
No matter how much you pretend
 to be God, even your power has limits...

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:31.550
Shut up!

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:34.730
You're just scum that doesn't know its places!

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:37.000
Loser's talk.

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.200
I end my turn.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:42.660
Damnit, you're making fun of me!

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:45.480
Fine. If that's case, let me show you something!

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:50.220
It's time for another round of
<i>The Shocking Truth</i>!

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.520
Da-da-da-duuuun!!

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:56.530
Nasch!

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:58.040
There's... !?

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:01.860
Using that Gilag, I managed to trap him.

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:05.170
You bastard! Why are you doing all this!?

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:08.360
Have a good look at the shape Nasch's in!

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:12.310
See something? The shape he's in?

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:19.170
He's in shreds,
while I'm fresh as a breeze.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.730
And he lets me recover my life over and again, see?!

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.170
It can't be!! You bastard take Nasch's ... !?

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:26.860
You finally noticed?

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:31.700
When I use "Don Thousand's Throne" to gain more Life Points...

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:35.850
... <i>I AM</i> draining it <i>all</i> from Nasch here!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:41.350
In other words, <i>you</i> morons
have been scraping away Nasch's life!

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:42.490
{marker}

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:46.670
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:51.910
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:06:59.490 --> 00:07:03.600
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:07.780
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:14.600
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:18.580
the feelings I want to express.

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:27.600
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:30.850
Right now, with you

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:34.780
Oh - By facing each other,

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:41.860
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:46.960
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:52.390
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:57.560
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:07:58.460 --> 00:08:07.140
...on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:18.100
You bastards!

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:22.100
Alit, have you really stabbed us 
in the back and joined hands with 'em!?

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:25.980
You have to be an idiot to defy Master Don Thousand!

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:26.860
<i>My Body as a Shield! Durbe's Final Vow!</i>

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.360
Gilag, listen, you've been tricked!!

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:29.480
Yeah!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:33.530
Don Thousand's been rewriting your memories!

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:36.910
You wanna say, that <i>I</i> have been tricked and used...?

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:38.580
Are you kidding?

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:42.250
I'll take your rotton souls, squish them and eat them <i>myself</i>!

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:43.410
Gilag!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.250
It's useless.

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:45.120
Alit!?

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:48.840
We probably have to be break Don Thousand's Spell over him

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.500
just like you did with me.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:53.510
To destroy his Over Hundred Numbers

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.970
we have no choice but to use
the Numbers from the Ruins.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.390
In that case, let's duel him.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:02.890
No. I will.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.350
Alit... but you're...?!

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.860
Yes... yeah.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.820
Since I lost my powers as a Barian...

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.030
I can't use my Over Hundred Numbers anymore,

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:18.240
but..., this is a duel only I can do!

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:22.750
The best friend he ever had was me!

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:27.790
Alit ...

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:31.960
Allright... then use that one, will you.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.630
Oh ... ? This card is ... !?

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:40.470
The Number from Gilag's Ruins.
It's for Gilag's curse.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:42.930
<i>Thank you</i>, Yuma!

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.100
Alit ...

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:45.310
... I trust in you.

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:48.600
Absolutely... make sure you don't lose, right?

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.060
Sure!

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:53.030
Gilag! Let's duel!

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:56.320
That's interesting, you <i>filthy</i> traitor!!

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:00.280
I'll consume your soul!! Alit!!

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:05.410
I'll turn you back to normal,
no matter what it takes!

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.660
Gilag!!!

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:13.960
Duel!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:17.970
I get to go first! My turn!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:19.550
Draw!

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:23.720
I Normal Summon "Burning Knuckler Big Bandage"!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:30.810
Then I set two cards face down
and end my turn!

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:35.070
Here I come, Alit~! My turn, draw!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.820
Tha... that...

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:42.120
You mean, our attacks have been
draining my Nasch's life away?

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.490
That's...

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:46.750
Merag...!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.290
How dirty can you go!?

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:56.090
It's fun seeing you morons suffering that bad!!

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:58.760
So you're rotten down to your soul!?

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.930
My turn! Draw!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:03.930
Here I come, Vector!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:08.180
I activate, "Rank-Up-Magic the Seventh One"!

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:13.940
I re-build the Overlay Network with the Rank 4 Glorious Halo!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.860
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:23.070
Come, Chaos Number 102!

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:28.410
Unholy Lightning Noble Daemon!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.840
Vector, now I will strike you bastard down,

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.750
with a single attack!

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:40.720
With this, I'll save Nasch and win this duel.

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:42.720
Durbe...

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:47.100
I activate the Spell Card, "Holy Rage," from my Graveyard!

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:49.350
By banishing this card,

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:53.150
my noble Daemon gains 2000 Attack!

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:59.110
Even though you pumped your monster's attack,
you still can't beat me instantly.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:03.160
I'm not done yet!
I actviate Noble Daemon's effect!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.780
By using one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:08.740
I can negate the effect of an opponent's monster

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.750
and make its Attack zero!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:15.500
What the hell did you say!?

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:19.090
With this, you bastard will take 4900 damage!

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:22.760
I'll wipe away your Life Points with a single attack.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:26.350
But feel relieved. I'll be going to hell with you,

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:29.100
to make sure you don't escape.

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.600
What do you mean!?

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:34.440
When fighting the Monster targeted by Holy Rage,

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:38.400
I will receive the same damage as my opponent.

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.440
Durbe!?

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:44.070
You also plan to end this duel in a draw!?

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:47.740
Noble Daemon, attack Soul Marionetter!

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:52.120
You will go to hell with me! Vector!!

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.170
Now, Vector!

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.760
I activate the Continuous Trap Card, "Evil 1"!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.760
When I would take Battle Damage...

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:10.470
... my monster's destruction is negated,

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:14.560
and no matter how much Damage I
would have taken, my Life Points become 1!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:17.560
Durbe!

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.780
That was close, too close.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:26.780
Any closer and I've gone to hell in a tie with you bastard.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.580
That you still had such a card ...

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.580
Sucks to be you, Durbe!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:35.830
What's the matter? End your turn already!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.290
Turn end.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:42.710
And Noble Daemon's Attack returns to normal.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:47.130
Now, I activate the effect of "Don Thousand's Throne"!!

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.560
Nasch!!

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:58.230
This is what you get after all that hard work, idiots!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:04.360
So you set "Evil 1" in case something like this happened?

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:09.200
Yeah ... but now those guys are ...

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:15.620
Now, let's go! Appear, Chaos Number 106!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:20.540
Giant Hand Red!

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:23.800
Droppin' your ace this soon?

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:29.050
I ain't done! I Normal Summon "Fire Hand"!

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:39.940
And now!

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:42.150
I Special Summon "Prominence Hand"!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:46.650
When I control a Pyro-Type Monster on my field,

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:49.570
I can Special Summon this monster from my hand!

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:58.620
I overlay my Level 4 "Fire Hand" and "Prominence Hand"!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:04.800
I build the Overlay Network with these two monsters!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.010
Xyz Summon!

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:12.140
Come forth, Number 58!

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:17.350
Burning Viser the Burning Vice Ogre!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:20.190
From this number...

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.810
I can feel Don Thousand's power coming from there.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:25.070
Wha--!? That means ...

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.070
Probably just like with Alit,

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:31.070
Don Thousand's gave it to him to strengthen his spell over him.

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:34.950
By detaching all Overlay Units attached to this Monster,

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:37.740
I can equip it to an Xyz monster.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:41.870
I equip my Burning Viser to my Giant Hand Red!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:49.170
And now! A monster equipped with Burning Viser

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.880
can attack my appointment directly!!

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:55.100
This is your end, bastard!

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:59.390
My turn, Draw!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:03.810
I send my Continuous Trap Card "Evil 1"
from the field to the Graveyard

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:05.940
to activate its other effect!

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:10.070
I can destroy one card on the field!

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:15.990
But during the turn I use this effect, just I can't battle...

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:20.330
Now, whatever should I destroy here~?

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.130
I destroy...

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:31.050
... the Damage Pot on my field!

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:33.010
Your own Trap!?

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:36.800
When this one leaves the field,

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:40.600
the Damage it absorbed is dealt to every player on the field!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.600
It sucked up 1300 Damage before!

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:45.850
In other words, we all

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:49.110
will each take 1300 Damage!

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.280
With that, you go off to hell and I stay safe and sound!

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:55.860
Bye bye, scumbags!

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.540
As things stand...

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:04.460
Merag...

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:13.130
Counter Trap activate, "Saint Shield"!

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:17.800
With this card, all the damage inflicted from one Trap card

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.600
is negated!

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.010
Wh-what the hell!?

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:24.430
Then, the amount of damage negated

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:28.060
will be added to the ATK of one fairy-type Monster!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:32.990
I'll have "Ragna Infinity" gain 3900 Attack!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.990
The effect damage would have hit 3 of us...

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:39.120
And with an Attack of 6700...

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:43.450
Durbe ... With this,
during my next turn, he'll be...

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:46.580
... Durbe!?

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:49.540
Merag, farewell.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.250
Wha... what did you say!?

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:56.760
When this turn ends, Saint's Shield effect will give...

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:00.890
... all the negated damage directly back to me.

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.930
That is...!? Durbe!

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.600
I'm sorry, Merag.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:08.810
I was unable to beat this bastard for you.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.270
Please forgive me for my incompetence.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.570
Durbe!

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:16.610
You and Nasch are the most important people in the world to me.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.910
As a Human and as a Barian,

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:24.330
I'm happy I was able to know you in both worlds...

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:27.750
Crush him, Merag!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.670
I end my turn with this.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.760
Durbe!!

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.970
Merag. Nasch.

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:49.060
I'm really glad... I was able to meet you...

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.270
Durbe!!!

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:05.790
I have my Giant Hand Red, equipped with Burner Viser

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.870
attack you directly!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.000
Alit!

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.260
I'm not down for the count yet!

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:30.190
The worst of Burner Viser has yet to come!

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:33.270
This guy lets me send one card from my hand to the Graveyard

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:36.230
to deal 500 damage to my opponent!

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:37.900
Like this!!

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.280
Tha- that's bad! Alit!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.000
Now, once again!

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:01.380
Good, good! Your voice sounds <i>much</i> better when you scream!

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:04.300
This is so cruel. Stop already!

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.390
Now, this is the end!

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:08.890
'Farewell', Alit!!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.890
Alit!!!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:16.900
I activate the Counter Trap, "Hyper Burning"!

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:22.990
With this card, if my Life Points would be depleted by damage,

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:25.820
before they are, I can halve my Life Points,

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.240
to make that damage zero!!

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:30.750
Whaat!?

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:34.670
I'll show you...

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:39.710
... a heart so truely hot, it will even burn down flames!

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:49.720
Even though he lost his Barian powers, his way of fighting still is spectacular.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:52.640
Alit! You're still so freakin' cool!

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:56.400
My turn! Draw!

00:20:56.560 --> 00:21:00.150
Durbe, I received your thought for sure.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:07.660
With the power you gave me at the cost of your life, I certainly...

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:11.160
Vector, prepare yourself!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.620
Thanks to Durbe's power,

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:19.290
my Ragna Infinity's Attack is now 6700.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:22.300
<i>Your </i>monster has zero Attack!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.930
and it's monster effects are negated too!

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.600
My turn! Draw!

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:33.600
I'll have my Ragna Infinity attack your Soul Marionetter!

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:40.610
I'll crush your life with this blow!

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:57.710
Durbe, this was my revenging blow.

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:02.000
I could only win, because you gave me your power...

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:10.300
{marker}

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.970
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:16.390
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:18.650
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:22.320
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:24.940
Let it go.

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:38.210
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:43.420
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:49.340
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:54.680
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:59.520
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:05.400
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:07.570
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.570 --> 00:23:11.950
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.830
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:17.580
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:22.040
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:24.170
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:27.010
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:29.420
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:32.930
Challenge the GAME

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:44.610
Paying tribute to Durbe's feelings, Merag stands up against Vector.

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:47.570
Then the chaosified Soul Marionetter appears,

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:51.360
turning the fight into an ice cold funeral...

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:53.450
From his heart, I will...

00:23:53.740 --> 00:23:55.370
You are Ponta!

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:56.660
Alit's future is...

00:23:56.660 --> 00:23:57.620
Don't tell me?!

00:23:57.620 --> 00:24:00.410
Will pulverize you, Vector!

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:02.920
Next Time, on Yu-Gi-Oh ZEXAL II!

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:05.790
A Goodbye Is Only for a Moment... The Sad Fate of the Siblings

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:08.590
Please, Rouga, only you can...
